    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112114" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορίνη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skin</i> or
				<i>hide of pachydermatous animals,</i> esp. of <i>swine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Acut.(Sp.)</i><i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.381c
			</span></i>, etc.; of the rhinoceros, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.44
			</span></i>; of the ox, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1915.13
			</span></i>; of the chamaeleon, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				4.33
			</span></i>; of the tortoise's <i>shell,</i> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				303
			</span></i>: also of <i>human skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristomen.
				10
			</span></i>; metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. παχεῖαν φέρων</span>
				'thick-<i>skinned</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.57a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fat,</i>
			
